---
<BaseLayout meta={meta}>
<div data-meno-label="Page content" class="body min-h-screen [color:#fff] [background-color:#080610] [overflow-x:hidden]">

<div class="page-wrapper [color:#fff] [overflow-x:hidden]">
    <NavBanner />
    <div id="cards" class="main-wrapper [z-index:0] [color:#fff] [background-color:#080610] [max-width:none] [position:relative] [overflow-x:hidden]">
      <section class="section-hero case-study [background-image:url('../images/Hero_1.avif')] [background-position:0_100%] [background-repeat:no-repeat] [background-size:cover] [background-attachment:scroll] [padding-top:200px] [padding-bottom:120px] max-lg:[background-position:0%] max-lg:[background-size:cover] max-lg:[padding-top:80px] max-sm:[padding-top:80px] max-sm:[padding-bottom:40px]">
        <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-1280 w-container [margin-left:auto] [margin-right:auto] [max-width:1360px] [display:block] [width:100%] [padding-left:40px] [padding-right:40px] [text-decoration:none] max-lg:[max-width:728px] max-lg:[margin-top:0] max-lg:[padding:40px] max-sm:[max-width:none] max-sm:[padding-top:40px] max-landscape:[max-width:none] max-landscape:[margin-top:0] max-landscape:[padding-top:64px] max-landscape:[padding-left:20px] max-landscape:[padding-right:20px]">
          <div class="wrapper-hero fr-1-15 [grid-column-gap:40px] [grid-row-gap:40px] [grid-template-rows:auto] [grid-template-columns:1.15fr_1fr] [grid-auto-columns:1fr] [display:grid] max-lg:[grid-column-gap:20px] max-lg:[grid-row-gap:20px] max-lg:[flex-flow:column] max-lg:[justify-content:flex-end] max-lg:[align-items:center] max-lg:[display:flex] max-landscape:[grid-column-gap:20px] max-landscape:[grid-row-gap:20px]">
            <div class="left-hero max-680 [grid-column-gap:48px] [grid-row-gap:48px] [flex-flow:column] [justify-content:center] [max-width:680px] [display:flex] max-lg:[grid-column-gap:12px] max-lg:[grid-row-gap:12px] max-lg:[text-align:center] max-lg:[order:1] max-lg:[align-items:center] max-lg:[max-width:100%] max-sm:[grid-column-gap:16px] max-sm:[grid-row-gap:16px]">
              <div wb-interval-delay="0.2" wb-component="smart-animate" class="gap-4 [grid-column-gap:12px] [grid-row-gap:12px] [flex-flow:column] [display:flex] max-lg:[justify-content:flex-start] max-lg:[align-items:center]">
                <div class="w-layout-hflex flex-block-2 [flex-direction:row] [align-items:flex-start] [display:flex] [grid-column-gap:4px] [grid-row-gap:4px] max-sm:[text-align:center] max-sm:[flex-flow:row] max-sm:[justify-content:flex-start] max-sm:[align-items:center]">
                  <a href="/resources/customer-stories" class="text-caps [color:#fff9] [letter-spacing:4.2px] [text-transform:uppercase] [font-family:Switzer,_sans-serif] [font-size:14px] [font-weight:400] [line-height:150%] [text-decoration:none] max-landscape:[font-size:12px] max-sm:[font-size:10px]">Customer stories</a>
                  <div class="text-caps [color:#fff9] [letter-spacing:4.2px] [text-transform:uppercase] [font-family:Switzer,_sans-serif] [font-size:14px] [font-weight:400] [line-height:150%] [text-decoration:none] max-landscape:[font-size:12px] max-sm:[font-size:10px]">&gt;</div>
                  <div class="text-caps [color:#fff9] [letter-spacing:4.2px] [text-transform:uppercase] [font-family:Switzer,_sans-serif] [font-size:14px] [font-weight:400] [line-height:150%] [text-decoration:none] max-landscape:[font-size:12px] max-sm:[font-size:10px]">Mirakl</div>
                </div>
                <div class="text-16-150 color-white-80 hide [letter-spacing:.2px] [text-wrap:balance] [margin-top:0] [margin-bottom:0] [font-family:Switzer,_sans-serif] [font-size:16px] [font-weight:400] [line-height:150%] [display:none] [color:#fcfcfccc] [text-decoration:none] max-lg:[letter-spacing:.2px] max-lg:[font-size:15px] max-lg:[text-align:center] max-landscape:[letter-spacing:.2px] max-landscape:[font-size:14px] max-sm:[font-size:13px]">This wasn’t just about a fresh logo; it was about crafting a brand and digital presence that matched their ambition, stood out in the competitive AI space, and resonated with their target audience.</div>
                <div class="text-16-150 color-white-80 hide [letter-spacing:.2px] [text-wrap:balance] [margin-top:0] [margin-bottom:0] [font-family:Switzer,_sans-serif] [font-size:16px] [font-weight:400] [line-height:150%] [display:none] [color:#fcfcfccc] [text-decoration:none] max-lg:[letter-spacing:.2px] max-lg:[font-size:15px] max-lg:[text-align:center] max-landscape:[letter-spacing:.2px] max-landscape:[font-size:14px] max-sm:[font-size:13px]">Through close collaboration and iterative feedback, we partnered with them to launch their new identity and create a powerful foundation for growth, ensuring their brand reflected their evolution and their goals as a startup.</div>
                <h1 class="h1 [color:#fff] [text-wrap:balance] [margin-top:0] [margin-bottom:0] [padding-right:0] [font-family:Switzer,_sans-serif] [font-size:48px] [font-weight:600] [line-height:120%] max-lg:[font-size:44px] max-landscape:[font-size:38px] max-sm:[font-size:28px] max-sm:[font-weight:600]"><span class="span-pink-2 [box-sizing:border-box] [-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent] [background-image:linear-gradient(90deg,_#ff13bb,_#e225ff_39%,_#5a55ff)] [-webkit-background-clip:text] [background-clip:text]">Mirakl Case Study: </span>Scaling Enterprise Marketing Content Across Channels</h1>
                <div class="text-16-150 color-white-80 [letter-spacing:.2px] [text-wrap:balance] [margin-top:0] [margin-bottom:0] [font-family:Switzer,_sans-serif] [font-size:16px] [font-weight:400] [line-height:150%] [color:#fcfcfccc] [text-decoration:none] max-lg:[letter-spacing:.2px] max-lg:[font-size:15px] max-lg:[text-align:center] max-landscape:[letter-spacing:.2px] max-landscape:[font-size:14px] max-sm:[font-size:13px]">Mirakl came to us in late 2025 for a 2-minute explainer video. Over 7 months, our partnership grew across 6 contracts and 8 projects, producing 30+ videos and 11 Lottie animations. As their B2B video marketing needs expanded across multiple campaigns and channels, they needed flexible, reliable creative support. We helped them scale content efficiently, stay on brand, and maintain quality across every deliverable.</div>
